        "TileImage": "$($repository ee2af034-8ebe-43f8-a8f3-525e060dbb31).Image",
        "Description": "We have been contacted by the Knoxes for one last time, 47.\r\rDue to the recent success of rival company Kowoon Industries, Robert has organized an &quot;accident&quot; with their prize racer, Moses. Unfortunately, the bomber was discovered with incriminating evidence and is likely being interrogated. \rAlbert Noah, a notorious blackmailer, has been trying to extort Sierra Knox for a while. \r\rYou only have 10 minutes before Morrison cracks. If Noah is not dead by then, he will surely escape.\r\rGood luck, 47.",
